---
// Ana sayfa ve Astroloji kategorisinde Melek Kartları'na yönlendiren şerit.
---
<a class="mk-strip" href="/melek-kartlari/">
  <span class="mk-cards" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span>
  <span class="mk-text">
    <span class="mk-label">Günün melek kartı</span>
    <span class="mk-title">Bir soru düşün, kartını seç, mesajını oku.</span>
  </span>
  <span class="mk-go">Kartını çek →</span>
</a>

<style>
  .mk-strip {
    display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 1rem; flex-wrap: wrap;
    margin-top: 0.8rem; padding: 0.8rem 1.2rem; border-radius: 999px;
    background: linear-gradient(100deg, #e1daf0 0%, #f3d9e1 100%);
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
  }
  .mk-strip:hover .mk-go { color: var(--accent-deep); }
  .mk-cards { position: relative; width: 44px; height: 28px; flex: none; }
  .mk-cards i {
    position: absolute; top: 0; width: 20px; height: 28px; border-radius: 3px;
    background: #4b3a6b; border: 1.5px solid #d9c9a3;
  }
  .mk-cards i:nth-child(1) { left: 0; transform: rotate(-12deg); }
  .mk-cards i:nth-child(2) { left: 12px; }
  .mk-cards i:nth-child(3) { left: 24px; transform: rotate(12deg); }
  .mk-text { display: flex; gap: 0.8rem; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: baseline; }
  .mk-label { font-weight: 600; }
  .mk-title { font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 1.1rem; }
  .mk-go { margin-left: auto; font-weight: 600; color: var(--ink); }
  @media (max-width: 640px) { .mk-strip { border-radius: 12px; } .mk-go { margin-left: 0; } }
</style>
